          "detail": "Summons Clockwork Core when casting the supported skill, or moves Clockwork Core if it already exists\nClockwork Core cannot move on its own and can be supported by Activation Medium: Sentry, but is unaffected by Sentry-related stats\nThe supported skill is attached to Clockwork Core in the form of Spell Tangle, and will only attach to Clockwork Core\nWhile Clockwork Core exists, the supported skill is always attached to Clockwork Core at Max Tangle Quantity\nWhen the supported skill lands a Critical Strike, -0.1s Cooldown for all skills. Interval: 0.2s\nBonuses to Clockwork Core are also applied to the supported skill\nClockwork Core lasts 8s, and is affected by Skill Effect Duration bonuses.",
          "tags": [
            "Spell"
          ],
